WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.426
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:12.427 --> 00:00:15.502
I'm a camel.

3
00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:21.553
We are mammals with humps on our backs.

4
00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.621
Where do you live?

5
00:00:24.622 --> 00:00:29.403
Camels live mostly in Asia.

6
00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:34.110
We live in the rocky desert.

7
00:00:34.111 --> 00:00:37.196
Do you live alone?

8
00:00:37.197 --> 00:00:39.884
Oh no.

9
00:00:39.885 --> 00:00:44.276
We live in big groups.

10
00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:50.904
Is it hard to live in the desert?

11
00:00:50.905 --> 00:00:58.071
Yes. It gets very hot and very cold.

12
00:00:58.072 --> 00:01:06.915
The wind blows sand and ice at us.

13
00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:11.947
That wind sounds awful!

14
00:01:11.948 --> 00:01:18.266
We can close our nose holes.

15
00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:23.195
Then sand and ice can't blow into them.

16
00:01:23.196 --> 00:01:29.154
And our long eyelashes protect our eyes.

17
00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:32.534
What do you eat?

18
00:01:32.535 --> 00:01:36.910
Camels eat most desert plants.

19
00:01:36.911 --> 00:01:41.289
We even eat thorns!

20
00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:45.992
Why do you have those humps?

21
00:01:45.993 --> 00:01:51.778
Food and water are hard to find here.

22
00:01:51.779 --> 00:01:55.890
Our humps store fat.

23
00:01:55.891 --> 00:02:04.560
Fat helps us go without food or water.

24
00:02:04.561 --> 00:02:12.058
I see some other camels.

25
00:02:12.059 --> 00:02:17.476
Good-bye, Camel!

